{"id": "1554161810129555487", "channel_id": "1554061613978484766", "author_id": "331851840604078080", "author_name": "scottsunfall", "content": "I see this as a two step foward one step back, everyone, and i do mean EVERYONE, was strictly complaining about D-tide being horrible for new players and whales alike, with madness being overtuned and hard being an obscene leap in difficulty, the current changes fixes most of the problems for new players and make the game mode way more approachable, now all that's left to do is to fix the higher difficulties to the point that any character can clear it, even if AA's are necessary to make whales happy.", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T16:04:10.465000+00:00", "thread_id": "1554061613978484766", "reactions": [{"emoji": "❤️", "emoji_id": null, "count": 1}], "thread_title": "Dtide is out of control.", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542484945447026708", "1542484013652910141", "1542479601241030726"]}
