{"id": "1554174649372254219", "channel_id": "1543760297637187614", "author_id": "411126601120743424", "author_name": "flocke999", "content": "- loot is significantly buffed compared to pre-hell d-tide\n- purple gnosis are unlocked in A~SS (A3~A5) instead of A2~A5 (but its also doubled)\n- full SS (A5) needed for full loot is unchanged\n- full C gives more silver than full A5 pre-hell\n- old A5 is roughly equal to S\n- old A1 is harder than current C, but the difference between old difficulties and new difficulties diminish with alerts until roughly equalizing at A5=S\n- ecogs can now be used, although doesnt appear on leaderboards", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T16:55:11.579000+00:00", "thread_id": "1543760297637187614", "edited_timestamp": "2026-09-28T19:13:43.194000+00:00", "reactions": [{"emoji": "❌", "emoji_id": null, "count": 1}], "thread_title": "D-tide Discussion", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1542484945447026708", "1542479601241030726"]}
